NODE 15 6 INF 0 0 0 0 0
NODE 16 6 INF 0 0 0 0 0
NODE 17 6 INF 0 0 0 0 0
MATRIX 0 6 6 DENSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 INF 0 0 0 0 0 0 INF 0 0 0 0 0 0 INF 0 0 0 0 0 0 INF 0 0 0 0 0 0 INF
